# Wave W17-AC (Route 228): wash sand — the wash road’s worn sand, design-authorised: a warm worn sand running Palmside’s shore up the green island to where the road gives out under the storm fence, pebble flecks settled in its tread (design: the charts give up at the fence; the road gives up at the sand’s edge). Split from the shipped sand it crosses by wear entire (a trodden road-sand vs the desert’s own untouched family, which stands byte-preserved) and from Route 227’s ash sand by warmth: wash-warm here, ash-cool there.
